WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
That means that city property and unwilling private businesses

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.400
will no longer serve as staging grounds for these raids.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.760
An ice-free zone kind of sounds like

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.600
they're flirting with secession.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.120
Democrats are throwing around the S-word.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.040
Mother Jones, it's time for soft secession.

